<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Napier and Christchurch was 463 NZ cents per kg clean vs 467 cents at last week's sale, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean) were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 814 vs 820</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 499 vs 503</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 424 vs 430</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - n/a</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
